# apps/mobile may only ever hold PUBLIC values: anything here ships inside the
# app bundle and is readable by anyone who downloads it. Secrets belong in
# apps/api (see its .env.example).
#
# Variables are added in the milestone that first needs them, per CLAUDE.md.
# Milestone 0 needs none: the placeholder screen talks to nothing.
# Milestone 3 adds EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL, EXPO_PUBLIC_AUTH0_DOMAIN,
# EXPO_PUBLIC_AUTH0_CLIENT_ID and EXPO_PUBLIC_AUTH0_AUDIENCE.
